message: "If you use Mithridates in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "Mithridates"
abstract: >-
  A local laboratory of deliberately vulnerable services. Each service demonstrates one
  attack and ships the affected feature twice, vulnerable and fixed, behind one interface.
